  "Description": "We are only weeks away from our first crewed launch, and you will be the first person to ever travel to space!\n\nIn preparation for the upcoming launch, the backup crew of your upcoming flight will need to run a few rehearsals. To prepare for this, you will need to enter the capsule to set up the electrical system, and perform a complete interior inspection.",
